flowchart TD
    %% merge_file(base, local, upstream) for one path
    in[base, local, upstream] --> agree{local equals upstream?}
    agree -->|yes| nothing[Nothing to do]
    agree -->|no| localSame{local equals base?}
    localSame -->|yes| take[Apply upstream]
    localSame -->|no| upSame{upstream equals base?}
    upSame -->|yes| nothing
    upSame -->|no| engram{Engram file?}
    engram -->|yes| fm[Frontmatter key by key, body line by line]
    engram -->|no| lines[diffy::merge line by line]
    fm & lines --> parses{Result still parses?}
    parses -->|yes| take
    parses -->|no| conflict[Conflict: local file untouched]

    %% conflict markers never reach a file
    style conflict fill:#fdecea,stroke:#b3261e
